The prebuilt 68000 binaries a standalone build carries.

ymx/publish.sh copies dist/release/*.bin here before it builds, so the
executable needs neither a repository nor an SDK. A tree whose dist/ was
empty carries none, and the combiners then resolve them as they always
have, through YMX_CORE, YMX_STUB and YMX_REPO.

The .bin files are build output and are not committed.
